flowchart TD
 A[Message and protocol] --> B[Classify and retrieve]
 B --> C{Sufficient evidence?}
 C -->|Yes and no action needed| D[Grounded answer]
 C -->|No or action required| E[Department queue]
 B -->|Ambiguous| F[Clarify]
 F --> B
 D --> G[Await confirmation]
 E --> H[Human response with full history]
 H --> G
 G -->|Confirmed| I[Complete]
 G -->|Not resolved| J[Continue with current support mode]